    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n43797" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐέπεια</span></b> , 
			Ion.
		 and poet. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐεπίη</span></b> 
		(q.v.), ἡ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐεπής</span>)
